.TH "GOOBERS CLOUD MIGRATE" "1" "" "Goobers" "Goobers Manual"
.SH NAME
goobers-cloud migrate \- Apply cloud data-store migrations.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgoobers-cloud migrate\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Usage: goobers-cloud migrate apply [OPTIONS]

Apply ordered cloud PostgreSQL migrations.

Options:
  --database-direct-url URL        Direct URL (prefer env/file for credentials)
  --database-direct-url-file PATH  Read direct URL from a mounted Secret
  --database-auth MODE             password or entra (default password)
  --backup-ref REF                 Restorable backup identifier or PITR mark (required)
  --instance-id ID                 Goobers instance owning the migration lease (required)
  --holder ID                      Unique migration pod/process identity

Environment:
  GOOBERS_DATABASE_DIRECT_URL  Direct PostgreSQL URL

A migration that cannot take its locks (a long reader, or another migration
holding the migration lock) is retried with backoff for up to 20 minutes.
If the database stays busy that long the command exits 75 (EX_TEMPFAIL):
nothing was applied in the busy step, and re-syncing the deployment once the
contention ends applies the remaining migrations. Any other failure exits 1.
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgoobers-cloud\fR(1)
